#: ui/DiagPage.qml:129
msgctxt "doctor finding, %1 = count, %2 = time"
msgid ""
"%1 BlueZ storage write failure (a new link key may be lost at reboot), last "
"%2"
msgid_plural ""
"%1 BlueZ storage write failures (a new link key may be lost at reboot), last "
"%2"
msgstr[0] ""
"%1 schrijffout in de BlueZ-opslag (een nieuwe koppelingssleutel kan bij "
